     "body": "<p>fixed in a branch from 3.6.2 at <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/tree/fcrepo-1196\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/tree/fcrepo-1196</a></p>\n\n<p>Workarounds: 1) Export items individually 2) Rebuild the client and server JAR files from the above branch</p>\n\n<p>These changes should be ported to master. It's arguable we should cut a 3.6.3 release so that we can delete that branch.</p>",
